  "full_text": "I wish I was a drummer boy. So, as I see the people with their slave masters and the opposite of intentions, I find myself with freedom and no woman, no woman. I'm welcome. I am. These sticks, I broke my hardwood sticks. Now I've got these. These are not as glorious as my hardwood, the one that I had. The sticks I used to have were like the wind. They were... Somebody sent me drumsticks. And they were... They were hewn from Mount Olympus hardwood or some shit, you know? They were the fucking... They were bad as a bomb. And I... And I broke them. Pegasus. So, no ham. You know what ham is? Ham is the person who wants to talk because they got nothing to say. Hello? Goodbye, what huh? So",
